  "id": "moban",
  "term": "Moban",
  "definition": "Moban is an antipsychotic medicine form of molindone hydrochloride. It works by blocking dopamine receptors in the brain, which can reduce excessive dopamine activity linked with schizophrenia-related symptoms and certain agitated or overactive behaviors.",
